            ("How do modern 'vineyard' concert halls solve the width limitation?", ["Short terraced retaining walls surround staggered seating blocks as local reflectors.", "Massive central pillars scatter bass tones evenly underneath seats.", "Overhead fiberglass parachutes cancel side echoes altogether.", "Circular stages spin musicians toward outer balconies continuously."], 0, "ITP-MOD-02", "B2", "Dinding penahan teras bertingkat menghadirkan pemantul lokal dekat setiap blok kursi."),
